#: templates/default/list_views.html:9
msgid ""
"Views serve different zone variants to different clients based on the "
"network that queried the resolver. Each variant is named zone..variant (for "
"example, example.com..trusted) and must exist as a separate zone in PowerDNS "
"before it can be assigned here. Variants share a name but resolve "
"differently per view, so the same hostname can answer with different IPs "
"depending on the client's network."
msgstr ""
"View menyajikan varian zona yang berbeda kepada klien yang berbeda "
"berdasarkan jaringan yang mengirim kueri ke resolver. Setiap varian dinamai "
"zone..variant (misalnya, example.com..trusted) dan harus sudah ada sebagai "
"zona terpisah di PowerDNS sebelum dapat ditetapkan di sini. Varian berbagi "
"nama yang sama tetapi diselesaikan secara berbeda pada setiap view, sehingga "
"nama host yang sama dapat menjawab dengan IP yang berbeda tergantung "
"jaringan klien."

