"The zone was created, but the transfer request was not accepted. The primary "
"may refuse AXFR, or PowerDNS will retry on its own refresh schedule."
msgstr ""
"Zona telah dibuat, tetapi permintaan transfer tidak diterima. Server primer "
"mungkin menolak AXFR, atau PowerDNS akan mencoba lagi sesuai jadwal refresh-"
